---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | SendCrypto.io"
  description="SendCrypto.io Privacy Policy. GDPR and CCPA compliant. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data."
>
  <Nav slot="nav" />
  <main>
    <div class="ltag">// privacy</div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="lmeta">Last Updated: May 30, 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; GDPR &amp; CCPA Compliant &nbsp;·&nbsp; Version 2.0</div>
    <div class="hbox"><p><strong>Short version:</strong> We collect your email only when you subscribe with explicit consent. We collect anonymous analytics only with your cookie consent. We do not sell your data. Ever. You can delete everything by emailing <a href="mailto:contact@sendcrypto.io">contact@sendcrypto.io</a>.</p></div>

    <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
    <p>SendCrypto.io operates a cryptocurrency-to-fiat rate comparison platform. We are the data controller for personal data processed in connection with this website. Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@sendcrypto.io">contact@sendcrypto.io</a></p>

    <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Essential data (no consent required — necessary for site operation):</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Server logs with anonymized IP addresses (last octet masked) — retained 30 days</li>
      <li>Session cookies required for site functionality — expire on browser close</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Data we collect with explicit consent only:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email address</strong> — only when you actively subscribe with checked consent box</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics data</strong> — pages visited, time on site, only after you accept analytics cookies</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate click attribution</strong> — anonymous session ID only (no email, no IP, no PII)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not collect: government IDs, financial account numbers, credit cards, SSNs, identity documents, location data, or any other special category data.</p>

    <h2>3. Legal Basis for Processing (GDPR Article 6)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Consent (Art. 6(1)(a)):</strong> Email newsletter subscriptions, analytics cookies</li>
      <li><strong>Legitimate interests (Art. 6(1)(f)):</strong> Anonymized server logs, security monitoring, affiliate tracking with anonymous session IDs</li>
      <li><strong>Legal obligation (Art. 6(1)(c)):</strong> Where required by applicable financial services regulations</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Your Rights Under GDPR and CCPA</h2>
    <p>You have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Access</strong> — request a copy of all personal data we hold about you</li>
      <li><strong>Rectification</strong> — correct any inaccurate data</li>
      <li><strong>Erasure</strong> — request deletion of all your personal data</li>
      <li><strong>Portability</strong> — receive your data in machine-readable format (JSON)</li>
      <li><strong>Withdraw consent</strong> — unsubscribe from emails at any time, revoke analytics consent</li>
      <li><strong>Object</strong> — to legitimate interest processing</li>
      <li><strong>Lodge complaints</strong> — EEA/UK users may contact their national data protection authority</li>
      <li><strong>CCPA non-discrimination</strong> — no penalty for exercising your rights</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise any right, email <a href="mailto:contact@sendcrypto.io">contact@sendcrypto.io</a>. We respond within 30 days (GDPR) or 45 days (CCPA).</p>

    <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p><strong>We do not sell your personal data.</strong> We share limited data with these service providers under written data processing agreements:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Supabase (US)</strong> — database hosting. SOC 2 Type II certified. Subject to SCCs for EEA transfers.</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare (US)</strong> — CDN, security, DNS. Processes anonymized IP logs only.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate partners</strong> — anonymous click IDs only. No email, no PII, no IP.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Email subscriptions: until unsubscribe + 30 days for audit trail, then permanent deletion</li>
      <li>Server logs (anonymized): 30 days</li>
      <li>Analytics data: 90 days, then anonymized aggregation only</li>
      <li>Affiliate click logs: 24 months for commission reconciliation (anonymous, no PII)</li>
      <li>Consent records: retained for the duration of GDPR statute of limitations (10 years from consent date) — required by GDPR Article 7(1)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Security</h2>
    <p>We implement strict security controls including TLS 1.3 for all data in transit, AES-256 encryption at rest, Row Level Security policies on every database table, anonymized IP logging, HMAC-signed API requests between services, rate limiting on all public endpoints, and quarterly security reviews. We will notify affected users of any data breaches within 72 hours as required by GDPR Article 33.</p>

    <h2>8. Cookies</h2>
    <p>See our detailed <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a>. Summary: we use only essential cookies by default. Analytics cookies require explicit opt-in via our cookie consent banner.</p>

    <h2>9. International Transfers</h2>
    <p>Our infrastructure is hosted in the United States. EEA transfers are protected by Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) approved by the European Commission. UK transfers are protected by the UK International Data Transfer Addendum.</p>

    <h2>10. Children</h2>
    <p>The Platform is not directed to anyone under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from minors. Contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@sendcrypto.io">contact@sendcrypto.io</a> if you believe we have inadvertently collected data from a minor.</p>

    <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>Material changes will be communicated to newsletter subscribers by email at least 30 days before taking effect. The "Last Updated" date will always reflect the current version.</p>

    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    <p>Privacy inquiries: <a href="mailto:contact@sendcrypto.io">contact@sendcrypto.io</a><br />Response time: Within 30 business days<br />Data Protection Officer: contact@sendcrypto.io</p>
  </main>

  <Footer slot="footer" />

  <style>
    main{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:140px 40px 100px}
    .ltag{font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px}
    h1{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:12px}
    .lmeta{font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:48px;padding-bottom:32px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
    h2{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin:40px 0 14px;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase}
    p{color:rgba(240,244,255,.8);margin-bottom:16px;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.75}
    ul{margin:0 0 16px 20px;color:rgba(240,244,255,.8);font-size:.95rem}
    ul li{margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.7}
    .hbox{background:rgba(0,255,136,.04);border:1px solid rgba(0,255,136,.15);border-radius:8px;padding:24px;margin:32px 0}
    .hbox p{margin:0;color:var(--text)}
    strong{color:var(--text)}
    a{color:var(--accent)}
    @media(max-width:768px){main{padding:100px 20px 60px}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
